%2F%20Where%20one%20parse%20has%20a%20leaf%20alone%20and%20the%20other%20a%20node%20that%20begins%20with%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20it%2C%20one%20of%20them%20reduced%20that%20leaf%20%28to%20a%20silent%20rule%2C%20or%20to%20the%20node%29%20where%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20the%20other%20shifted%20on%3A%20an%20LR%20parser%20decides%20between%20them%20on%20the%20token%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20after%20the%20leaf%2C%20the%20lookahead%2C%20and%20a%20leaf%20conflict%20after%20the%20lookahead%20is%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20no%20lexer%27s%2C%20as%20the%20two%20then%20lex%20in%20different%20parse%20states%20%28Rust%27s%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20%60%24%28...%29%3B%2A%60%2C%20whose%20%60%3B%60%20is%20a%20separator%20only%20after%20%60%24%28%60%20was%20shifted%29%3A%20a%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20silent%20rule%20reduced%20the%20leaf%20alone%20in%20one%20of%20them%2C%20or%20the%20node%2C%20or%20one%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20along%20its%20leftmost%20chain%2C%20ends%20with%20it.%20Where%20neither%20reduced%20it%20%28the%20%60%7B%60%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20of%20a%20JavaScript%20block%20and%20of%20an%20object%29%2C%20the%20two%20shift%20it%20alike.%20Two%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20leaves%20alike%20part%20at%20their%20end%20too%20where%20only%20one%20was%20reduced%20alone.%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20%60pending%60%20is%20the%20end%20of%20that%20leaf%2C%20%60decided%60%20the%20lookahead%27s%20start.%0A%20%20let%20pending%20%3D%20Infinity%3B%0A%20%20let%20decided%20%3D%20Infinity%3B%0A%20%20const%20lookahead%20%3D%20%28tree%29%20%3D%3E%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28decided%20%3D%3D%3D%20Infinity%20%26%26%20%21isTrivia%28tree%29%20%26%26%20firstLeafStart%28tree%29%20%3E%3D%20pending%29%20decided%20%3D%20firstLeafStart%28tree%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20An%20extra%20token%20of%20another%20kind%20is%20covered%20where%20the%20leaf%20wins%20the%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20lexical%20conflict%20with%20it%20%28Make%27s%20%60raw_line%60%20%60%23comment%5Cn%60%2C%20longer%20than%20the%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20comment%20of%20a%20lower%20precedence%29.%0A%20%20const%20covers%20%3D%20%28leaf%2C%20trivi